      {
        "text": "Qin Bai Sheng auctions it as the second item from the essence of the luck path true inheritance. The starting bid is a metal path rank seven Immortal Gu, so Fang Yuan can only watch from the sidelines.",
        "chapters": [
          760
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
