        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Five Elements Grandmaster wins with a rank seven metal path Immortal Gu, a rank six metal path Immortal Gu, and many immortal materials. Fang Yuan judges it a strong match for Spring Autumn Cicada: that Gu’s weakness is bad luck for the user, and Reverse Misfortune can remove that weakness and improve the user’s luck further into good luck. He also finds its effect more convenient than Connect Luck.",
        "chapters": [
          761
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
